Upstream base: tile-ai/tilelang@640fdcae3cd93620e5fcf98d36ee0ef7e17ae1f1
with the reworked eleven-patch compiler prefix and explicit-preparation
correction. Pre-metadata head: e963d826
Pre-metadata tree: c74164b94cbbc6ab8c83067852019c955092826d
Pre-metadata head: 4a521e2936319a69932af84247ae8f889654b231
